# graph_agents — the agent fleet.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored, and do not add them:
#   .claude/        the agents and skills ARE the product of this repo
#   .graph/runs/    run state is the fleet's memory; it is small and it is history

# Python bytecode (the hooks are stdlib Python)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# portfolio/registry.json is untracked on purpose: its path/entry_docs fields
# name real app directories on disk (personal names among them). It still
# exists locally and the fleet still reads it for routing — it is just not
# published. A fresh clone of this repo will not have it; see CURRENT-STATE.md.
portfolio/registry.json
